sequenceDiagram
  title Mention delivery
  participant Human
  participant SessionA as Session A
  participant PostalPlugin as Postal Plugin
  participant PluginKV as Plugin KV
  participant SessionB as Session B
  autonumber 1 1
  Human->>SessionA: prompt with @ses_B
  SessionA->>PostalPlugin: prompt admission hook
  PostalPlugin->>PluginKV: read rally window
  PluginKV-->>PostalPlugin: current count
  alt over rally limit
    PostalPlugin-->>SessionA: drop with warning
  else within limit
    PostalPlugin->>PostalPlugin: strip mention tokens
    PostalPlugin->>PostalPlugin: sign letter (HMAC)
    PostalPlugin->>SessionB: steer letter
    SessionB->>PostalPlugin: verify signature at admission
    Note right of SessionB: relay=true prevents loops
    SessionB->>PostalPlugin: postal_send reply (signed)
    PostalPlugin->>SessionA: steer reply (verified)
    SessionA-->>Human: reply in transcript
  end